Yêu cầu ứng viên
-    Có năm kinh nghiệm trong lĩnh vực thiết kế, đồ họa;
-    Sử dung thành thạo phần mềm chỉnh sửa video, thiết kế và các công cụ hỗ trợ khác;
-    Khả năng mỹ thuật tốt, tính năng động, sáng tạo, giàu ý tưởng và có tư duy sáng tạo và luôn chủ động trong công việc;
-    Có khả năng quay chụp, xử lý hậu kỳ và edit video là một lợi thế;

Mô tả công việc
About the role
We are looking for an experienced SAP MM consultant to lead the procurement and inventory management stream on our SAP S/4HANA implementation projects. You will plan the work, coordinate the team and work directly with customers, from discovery until the system is running smoothly.
Responsibilities:
Team leadership and planning
Build and coordinate the MM plan (tasks, milestones, resources) in line with the overall project plan; report progress and risks weekly to the project manager;
Assign work and coach junior consultants; review design documents, test scripts and configuration before handover;
Work with the PP, QM, SD, FI/CO, ABAP, Basis and integration teams to keep the procure-to-pay process running end to end;
Customer consulting
Run discovery workshops, compare current processes with SAP standard and propose a future process that fits the business;
Write and present solution design documents; handle change requests and assess their impact;
Act as the main contact for the customer's key users and leadership to settle business decisions and remove blockers;
SAP MM implementation
Configure purchasing (requisitions, purchase orders, contracts, approvals), inventory management (goods movements, physical inventory), invoice verification, material valuation and automatic postings;
Design master data and data migration; write functional specifications for reports, forms and interfaces, and sign off with developers;
Coordinate integration testing and user acceptance testing; train key users; support go-live and hypercare.
Yêu cầu ứng viên
Bachelor's degree in economics, supply chain, logistics, information technology or a related field;
5+ years of SAP MM implementation consulting, with at least 3 full life-cycle projects from discovery through go-live;
At least 1 project for a manufacturing company (raw material procurement, goods issue to production, finished goods receipt, subcontracting)
Experience integrating barcode scanning apps with SAP for goods receipt and goods issue processes;
Implementation experience on both SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition and Public Edition; clear understanding of their differences in configuration, extensibility and upgrade cycles;
At least 1–2 years as a team lead or module lead;
Strong planning, effort estimation, risk and scope management; knows when to escalate;
Strong communication, presentation and negotiation skills; comfortable with customer executives; makes decisions under deadline pressure;
Reads and writes design documents in English; proficient with SAP Fiori, SAP Activate, Jira or SAP Cloud ALM;
Uses AI tools (Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot, SAP Joule, etc.) effectively to draft documents and test scripts, analyze data and find root causes;
Always verifies AI output against the system or SAP documentation; never puts sensitive customer data into unapproved AI tools;
Shares effective AI practices with the team.
Bonus point:
PP, QM, SD:
MRP, production orders, quality inspection at goods receipt, stock transfers, deliveries;
FI/CO:
automatic account determination for inventory, GR/IR clearing, actual costing;
Integration and conversion:
IDoc, APIs, SAP BTP, SAP Ariba; SAP ECC to S/4HANA conversion projects;
Other:
knowledge of Vietnamese e-invoicing and inventory accounting rules; English communication skills.

benefits:
Attractive salary. Performance based award;
"FPT care" health insurance is exclusive for FPT employees;
Young and dynamic working environment;
Continuous development of hard and soft skills through work and professional trainings;
Exciting leisure: sport and art events (football club, family day...)
Company's labor policy completely pursuant to Vietnamese labor legislation plus other benefits offered by the company (Company trip, Holiday, etc.)

Chế độ đãi ngộ
Lương thỏa thuận cạnh tranh theo năng lực;
